msgid ""
"A bill of materials condition cannot use answers that create no variant "
"(%s): it is matched against the configured product, which does not carry "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Une condition de nomenclature ne peut pas citer de réponse qui ne crée pas "
"de variante (%s) : elle se compare au produit configuré, qui ne la porte "
"pas."

